---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.jsx';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="NERF BATTLES | Advanced Action Sports"
  description="Nerf battles at Advanced Action Sports in Webster, Massachusetts. Foam dart battles for kids, teens, and adults. Party packages, open play, and private events."
  canonical="https://www.advancedactionsports.com/nerf-battles/"
  ogTitle="NERF BATTLES | Advanced Action Sports"
  ogDescription="Nerf battles at Advanced Action Sports in Webster, Massachusetts. Foam dart battles for kids, teens, and adults. Party packages, open play, and private events."
>
<PageHero title="NERF BATTLES" btnUrl="https://advancedactionsports.square.site/s/search?q=nerf" btnText="Book Now" bgImg="nerf-kid-firing.avif" bgAlt="Young kid holding a Nerf blaster while aiming and firing during a battle" />

  <section class="page-actions">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="https://waivermaster.com/sign.html?q=MQH6WTTY" class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 6px;"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>Sign Waiver</a>
      <a href="/documents/2022rulesAdvanced.pdf" class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 6px;"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg>View Rules</a>
      
      <a href="/nerf-faq/" class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 6px;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>FAQ</a>
      <a href="https://advancedactionsports.square.site/s/shop" class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 6px;"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>Shop Nerf Gear</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Foam Dart Mayhem for All Ages</h2>
      <p>Nerf battles at Advanced Action Sports bring the backyard showdown to our professional arena. We've built dedicated Nerf fields with bunkers, barriers, and spawn points for fast-paced foam dart combat. Whether it's a birthday party, a youth group outing, or just a Saturday with friends, Nerf is pure adrenaline without the sting.</p>

      <h2>Party Central</h2>
      <p>Our Nerf party packages are the most popular choice for birthdays. Each package includes a private party host, dedicated arena time, all Nerf blasters and darts, eye protection, and a private party room for food and cake. Add extended play time, party favor bags, and pizza to build the ultimate celebration. Parents love that we handle everything.</p>

      <img src="/assets/images/nerf-kid-aiming-camera.avif" alt="Young kid aiming a Nerf blaster at the camera with a cool and cheeky expression" class="content-float-right" loading="lazy">

      <h2>Game Modes</h2>
      <p>We run a rotating selection of game modes: team deathmatch, free-for-all, capture the flag, VIP protection, and zombie survival. Our refs keep the energy high and rotate teams so everyone gets a fair shot. For younger players (ages 6-9), we run low-intensity games with simplified rules and shorter rounds.</p>

      <h2>Blasters &amp; Safety</h2>
      <p>All rental blasters are cleaned and tested before every session. We use standard Nerf Elite darts — no modified or third-party ammo. Eye protection is required for all players and provided on-site. Our arena is padded and designed for safe, active play. Parents are welcome to watch from the spectator area.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
